# 统一换行符：shell 脚本与生命周期脚本必须 LF，否则 Linux/CI 上无法执行
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
fpk/cmd/* text eol=lf
fpk/manifest text eol=lf
fpk/app/ui/config text eol=lf
fpk/wizard/* text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.PNG binary
*.fpk binary
